{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 2, "text": "二层天，十二层海》，逐层对此作了描述。按照这首布依族古歌，天的层次上有不同天体", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 257, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "二层天，十二层海》，逐层对此作了描述。按照这首布依族古歌，天的层次上有不同天体", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 257, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 3, "text": "与人的距离不同的蕴涵。从这个意义上说，比中国古代的“盖天说”、“浑天说”都有进步。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 322, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "与人的距离不同的蕴涵。从这个意义上说，比中国古代的“盖天说”、“浑天说”都有进步。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 322, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 4, "text": "但它又不同于古希腊的宇宙论，因为处在各层天上的不只有天体，还有云、雾、雷、雨等不", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 390, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "但它又不同于古希腊的宇宙论，因为处在各层天上的不只有天体，还有云、雾、雷、雨等不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 390, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 5, "text": "是天体的物质，未能将大气中的现象与天体分开，而且歌中的最高天是太阳高居的地方。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 455, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "是天体的物质，未能将大气中的现象与天体分开，而且歌中的最高天是太阳高居的地方。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 455, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 6, "text": "太阳居于最高天反映出一种太阳崇拜思想，因为太阳给人以温暖，给人以光明。在", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 523, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "太阳居于最高天反映出一种太阳崇拜思想，因为太阳给人以温暖，给人以光明。在", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 523, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 7, "text": "《十二层天，十二层海》中对第十二层天的描述是：", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 587, "w": 868, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《十二层天，十二层海》中对第十二层天的描述是：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 587, "w": 868, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 8, "text": "太阳比火烫，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 653, "w": 226, "h": 47}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "太阳比火烫，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 653, "w": 226, "h": 47}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 9, "text": "脱掉衣服汗水淌，", "bbox_px": {"x": 429, "y": 713, "w": 307, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "脱掉衣服汗水淌，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 429, "y": 713, "w": 307, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 10, "text": "穿上衣服汗水湿透衣装。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 780, "w": 431, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "穿上衣服汗水湿透衣装。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 780, "w": 431, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 11, "text": "难怪天下哪个旯旮都照到，", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 845, "w": 474, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "难怪天下哪个旯旮都照到，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 845, "w": 474, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 12, "text": "难怪天下哪个沟沟都照亮。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 913, "w": 474, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "难怪天下哪个沟沟都照亮。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 913, "w": 474, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 13, "text": "另外在第十一层天上还看到了天狗和石蚌（都卡）吃月亮，有太阳比月亮离人远的意", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 970, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "另外在第十一层天上还看到了天狗和石蚌（都卡）吃月亮，有太阳比月亮离人远的意", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 970, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 14, "text": "思。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1042, "w": 64, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "思。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1042, "w": 64, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 15, "text": "相对于第十二层天的第十二层海可以说是最深的海，那里的景象是：", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1098, "w": 1186, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "相对于第十二层天的第十二层海可以说是最深的海，那里的景象是：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1098, "w": 1186, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 16, "text": "海底大无边，海底好宽敞。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1171, "w": 454, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "海底大无边，海底好宽敞。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1171, "w": 454, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 17, "text": "海深三万丈，海宽四万丈。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1235, "w": 454, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "海深三万丈，海宽四万丈。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1235, "w": 454, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 18, "text": "石柱撑着大地，大地不动不摇。", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1300, "w": 539, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "石柱撑着大地，大地不动不摇。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 1300, "w": 539, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 19, "text": "岩柱撑着大海，大海不垮不倒。", "bbox_px": {"x": 434, "y": 1364, "w": 535, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "岩柱撑着大海，大海不垮不倒。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 434, "y": 1364, "w": 535, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 20, "text": "这是布依族先民对地球内部的想象，认为大地深层也是无边无际的海水，在海里有", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1424, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这是布依族先民对地球内部的想象，认为大地深层也是无边无际的海水，在海里有", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1424, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 21, "text": "石柱将人居住的大地稳稳地撑住。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1489, "w": 599, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "石柱将人居住的大地稳稳地撑住。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1489, "w": 599, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 22, "text": "（四）对方向方位的认识", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1561, "w": 434, "h": 40}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（四）对方向方位的认识", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1561, "w": 434, "h": 40}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 23, "text": "根据布依族学者黄义仁的调查和介绍，布依语固有词汇中没有东南西北四个方向的", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1617, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "根据布依族学者黄义仁的调查和介绍，布依语固有词汇中没有东南西北四个方向的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1617, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 24, "text": "称谓，但有水头水尾的称谓，因西南地区珠江水系河流大多由北而南，所以作为经验定向", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1682, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "称谓，但有水头水尾的称谓，因西南地区珠江水系河流大多由北而南，所以作为经验定向", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1682, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 298, "line_no": 25, "text": "法使用。布依语对应东西南北方向的词语是“卡若”［ka'0®］、“卡内”［ka'dau'］、“卡", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1738, "w": 1548, "h": 64}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "法使用。布依语对应东西南北方向的词语是“卡若”［ka'0®］、“卡内”［ka'dau'］、“卡", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1738, "w": 1548, "h": 64}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
